===Noun===
{{en-noun|brown trout}}

# A nonmigratory freshwater [[trout]] of species {{taxfmt|Salmo trutta|species}}, with dark spotted skin, native to [[Europe]] and [[Asia]].
#: {{syn|en|brown|brownie}}
